<doc id="174807" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174807" title="Mesclun">
Mesclun

Mesclun (]) yaiku salah sawijining olahan campuran macem-macem enom cilik &lt;a href="Janganan%20godhong"&gt;sayuran ijo salad&lt;/a&gt; sing asalé ing Provence, Prancis. Campuran tradisional kalebu chervil, arugula, lettuces godhong lan endive, dene istilah mesclun bisa uga nuduhake campuran sing bisa kalebu sawetara utawa kabeh &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayem&lt;/a&gt; papat lan &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayi&lt;/a&gt;, sayuran ijo collard, chard Switserlan (bit perak), mustar sayuran ijo, sayuran ijo dandelion, frisée, mizuna, mche (selada domba), radicchio, sorrel, utawa sayuran godhong seger liyane.
