<doc id="174808" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174808" title="Siopao">
Siopao

Siopao (simplified Chinese ;]), secara harfiah tegese "roti panas"), yaiku salah sawijining masakan Filipina versi indigenisasi roti kukus Kanton sing diarani &lt;a href="cha%20siu%20bao"&gt;cha siu bao&lt;/a&gt;. 
Ana turunan sing padha ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20Thailand"&gt;masakan Thailand sing&lt;/a&gt; diarani salapao (#ALIH). Salapao kadhang digawe nganggo isian manis kanggo panganan cuci mulut. Iki uga dadi favorit ing &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt;, sing diarani manapua.
