Flan

A flan, ing basa Inggris lan masakan liyane, yaiku sajian sing diwenehi &lt;a href="pastry"&gt;pastry&lt;/a&gt; open utawa rimmed utawa &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20spons"&gt;spons sing&lt;/a&gt; isine legi utawa &lt;a href="gurih"&gt;gurih&lt;/a&gt; ; conto yaiku &lt;a href="Quich%C3%A9"&gt;loric quiche&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tart%20custard"&gt;tart kastard&lt;/a&gt;, lan melktert Afrika Selatan. Flan dikenal ing masakan Roma. Biasane panganan sing gurih, kayata ing " &lt;a href="Sidhat"&gt;flut eel&lt;/a&gt; "; flan manis uga disenengi.

