<doc id="174893" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174893" title="Coulis">
Coulis

Coulis () iku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;sauce&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;pureed&lt;/a&gt; saring &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt;. Coulis sayuran umume digunakake ing sajian daging lan sayuran, lan uga bisa digunakake kanggo pangkalan &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; utawa saos liyane. Coulis woh asring digunakake ing &lt;a href="panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut&lt;/a&gt;. Contone, coulis &lt;a href="Raspb%C3%A9ri"&gt;raspberry luwih&lt;/a&gt; disenengi karo &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt; rebus utawa pie jeruk Key.

