<doc id="174928" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174928" title="Chả trứng">
Chả trứng

Chả trứng, uga chả trứng &lt;a href="wiktionary%3Ah%E1%BA%A5p"&gt;hấp&lt;/a&gt; (kukus) lan chả trứng thịt (daging babi), yaiku &lt;a href="Omel%C3%A8t"&gt;omelet&lt;/a&gt; kukus &lt;a href="Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, utawa roti daging endhog karo daging babi. Tr translng jarwa menyang endhog, ora diterjemahake menyang daging nanging biasane daging babi. Biasane disajeni nganggo nasi panas, timun lan sambel. Piring nasi sing pecah &lt;a href="c%C6%A1m%20t%E1%BA%A5m"&gt;cơm tấm&lt;/a&gt; bì (kulit) diwenehake karo meatloaf endhog ch trứng. Rươi Cha punika mangsan (Autumn) omelette khusus kanthi nggunakake nereididae sandworms (rươi) tinimbang daging babi.
