<doc id="174933" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174933" title="Silog">
Silog

Silog minangka kelas panganan sarapan Filipina sing ngemot &lt;a href="Sinang%C3%A1g"&gt;sinangag&lt;/a&gt; (nasi goreng) lan itlog (endhog; ing konteks, endhog goreng). Dheweke disuguhake nganggo macem-macem puisi utawa ulam, umume panganan daging kayata &lt;a href="Tapa%20%28masakan%20Filipina%29"&gt;tapa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="longganisa"&gt;longganisa&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng sajian daging sing ditemtokake nemtokake jeneng &lt;a href="portmanteau"&gt;portmanteau&lt;/a&gt; saka silog ; tuladhane, wong telu mau bakal dikenal kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Tapa%20%28masakan%20Filipina%29"&gt;tapsilog&lt;/a&gt;, longsilog, lan hamsilog. 
Sawise pangembangan tapsilog, akeh jinis silog liyane sing digawe, kabeh adhedhasar nasi goreng bawang putih lan endhog goreng, lan &lt;a href="Panambang"&gt;diisi&lt;/a&gt; nganggo -silog. Amarga sajian sing gampang ditrapake, umume apa wae bisa dadi silog yen disajeni karo nasi goreng lan endhog goreng. Tuladha cekak (kanthi urutan abjad) sing umume katon ing restoran silog lan restoran kalebu:
<ul>
<li>Adosilog - &lt;a href="Adobo%20Pilipina"&gt;adobo&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Bacsilog utawa baconsilog - &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Bisteksilog - &lt;a href="Bistek"&gt;steak daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Daingsilog - daing na iwak (iwak garing), nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<ul>
<li>Bangsilog - garing (daing) lan / utawa marus bangus (iwak &lt;a href="Iwak%20bandeng"&gt;bandeng&lt;/a&gt;), nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Dangsilog - daing na danggit (&lt;a href="Baronang"&gt;kelinci&lt;/a&gt; garing), nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
</ul>
<li>Chiksilog utawa noksilog - &lt;a href="Ayam%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;pitik goreng&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Ayam%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;ayam&lt;/a&gt; piniritong utawa ayam pritong), nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Chosilog - &lt;a href="chorizo"&gt;chorizo&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Cornsilog - &lt;a href="Korn%C3%A9t%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; jagung, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Hotsilog - &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;hotdog&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Litsilog utawa lechonsilog - &lt;a href="lechon"&gt;lechon&lt;/a&gt; utawa lechon kawali, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Longsilog - longganisa, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Masilog utawa malingsilog - &lt;a href="Daging%20mangan%20awan"&gt;Daging luncheon&lt;/a&gt; Cina merek Ma-Ling, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Porksilog - potong &lt;a href="Babi%20rajang"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Sisilog - &lt;a href="sisig"&gt;sisig&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Spamsilog - Daging luncheon merek Spam, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
<li>Tosilog utawa tocilog - &lt;a href="tocino"&gt;tocino&lt;/a&gt;, nasi goreng lan endhog goreng.</li>
</ul>
Ana sajian sing padha saka Malaysia, &lt;a href="nasi%20lemak"&gt;nasi lemak&lt;/a&gt;, sing disajikake kanthi macem-macem cara nggunakake daging, endhog lan beras karo &lt;a href="santen"&gt;santen&lt;/a&gt;. 
