<doc id="174965" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174965" title="Arrack">
Arrack

Arrack minangka &lt;a href="Ngombe%20alkohol"&gt;minuman beralkohol&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Distilasi"&gt;sulingan sing&lt;/a&gt; biasane diprodhuksi ing &lt;a href="Anak%20bawana%20India"&gt;bawana India&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;, digawe saka &lt;a href="Fermentasi%20%28panganan%29"&gt;wijen&lt;/a&gt; kembang klapa utawa &lt;a href="Tebu"&gt;tebu sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fermentasi%20%28panganan%29"&gt;difermentasi&lt;/a&gt;, uga gandum (kaya ta beras abang) utawa &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt; gumantung saka negara asale. Kadhang kala ditulis nganggo arak, utawa mung diarani 'rak utawa' rak. Ora usah bingung karo &lt;a href="Liquor"&gt;semangat suling&lt;/a&gt; rasa &lt;a href="Adas%20legi"&gt;anise sing&lt;/a&gt; diarani &lt;a href="Arak%20%28ngombe%29"&gt;Arak&lt;/a&gt; utawa Araq.
Tembung sing asale saka tembung &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; arak (&lt;a href="wiktionary%3A%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%82"&gt;عرق&lt;/a&gt;, ʿaraq), tegese 'sulingan'. Ing &lt;a href="W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;Timur Tengah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;Wétan&lt;/a&gt; Cedhak, tembung arak biasane digunakake kanggo omben-omben sing disaring saka &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt; lan dibumboni rasa &lt;a href="Adas%20legi"&gt;anise&lt;/a&gt;.
