<doc id="174975" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174975" title="Currywurst">
Currywurst

Currywurst ([ˈkœʁiˌvʊɐ̯st]) yaiku &lt;a href="Panganan%20cepet%20saji"&gt;panganan cepat saji sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Jerman"&gt;asale saka Jerman sing kalebu&lt;/a&gt; kukus, banjur &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; goreng (basa &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Bratwurst"&gt;Bratwurst&lt;/a&gt;) biasane dipotong dadi potongan cokelat lan dibumboni kari saus tomat, saos adhedhasar &lt;a href="Saos%20tomat"&gt;saos&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pasta%20tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pasta%20tomat"&gt;tempel tomat sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bubuk%20kari"&gt;diwadhahi bubuk kari&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20tomat"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; siap digawe bumbu kari lan rempah-rempah liyane. Piring iki asring disajikake karo &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kentang goreng&lt;/a&gt;.
Saiki, currywurst asring didol minangka &lt;a href="Gawa%20mulih"&gt;panganan sing digawa metu / dibawa&lt;/a&gt;, Schnellimbisse (toko cemilan), ing &lt;a href="Nedha%20bengi"&gt;restoran&lt;/a&gt; utawa " &lt;a href="Sendok%20greasy"&gt;sendok berminyak&lt;/a&gt;," kanggo menu bocah ing &lt;a href="restoran"&gt;restoran&lt;/a&gt;, utawa minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan ing dalan&lt;/a&gt; lan biasane disajikake karo &lt;a href="Kenthang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;kentang goreng&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;roti nggulung&lt;/a&gt; (Brötchen). Iki misuwur ing saindenging Jerman nanging utamane ing wilayah metropolitan ing Berlin, &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Area%20Ruhr"&gt;Area Ruhr&lt;/a&gt;. Variasi sing cukup, kalebu ing jinis sosis sing digunakake lan bahan saus, ana ing antarane wilayah kasebut. Variasi umum kalebu tambahan &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt; utawa bawang sing dicincang; Panganan panganan &lt;a href="halal"&gt;halal&lt;/a&gt; asring nyiyapake kari nganggo sosis daging sapi. Asring currywurst didol ing &lt;a href="kios%20panganan"&gt;kios panganan&lt;/a&gt;, kadang nggunakake mesin khusus kanggo diiris-iris, lan disedhiyakake ing piring kertas nganggo garpu kayu utawa plastik, &lt;a href="Garpu%20Currywurst"&gt;umume garpu Currywurst&lt;/a&gt;. Uga didol minangka produk &lt;a href="Supermarket"&gt;swalayan supermarket kanggo&lt;/a&gt; disiapake ing omah, kayata &lt;a href="Meica"&gt;Meica&lt;/a&gt; CurryKing.
Museum Deutsches Currywurst ngramal yen 800 yuta kari dipangan saben taun ing Jerman, kanthi 70 yuta ing Berlin wae. Tanduran &lt;a href="Volkswagen"&gt;Volkswagen&lt;/a&gt; ing Wolfsburg duwe toko daging dhewe ngasilake kira-kira 7 yuta kari Volkswagen saben taun, lan akeh kanggo karyawan Volkswagen. 
