<doc id="174986" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174986" title="Embutido kukus">
Embutido kukus

Embutido utawa embotido, yaiku &lt;a href="Lembar%20daging"&gt;meatloaf&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Filipina"&gt;Filipina sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;daging babi sing&lt;/a&gt; diiseni lan diiseni &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog rebus&lt;/a&gt; lan irisan &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt; utawa macem-macem &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane dibungkus nganggo &lt;a href="Foil%20aluminium"&gt;aluminium foil&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kukus"&gt;dikukus&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan bisa uga dipanggang. 
Embutido digawe kanthi nyampur &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;daging babi sing&lt;/a&gt; digiling karo &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;crumbs roti&lt;/a&gt; (utawa roti putih abon), &lt;a href="kismis"&gt;kismis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt; cincang, &lt;a href="Ngos%C3%A8ng"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bombay&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;putih&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt; kanggo rasa. Bahan liyane uga bisa ditambahake kanggo dicampur, kalebu manis &lt;a href="Relish"&gt;relish pickle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="nanas"&gt;nanas&lt;/a&gt; chunks, lan ngiris pimiento utawa &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;lonceng mrico&lt;/a&gt;. Campuran banjur dilebokake ing foil aluminium. &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;Endhog&lt;/a&gt; sing wis mateng &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt; diselehake dawa ing ndhuwur, uga irisan &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, sosis Wina, sosis longganisa, utawa uga &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;hotdog&lt;/a&gt;. Pengaturan kasebut ditutupi campuran daging babi sing luwih akeh lan dibungkus kanthi tliti kanthi foil aluminium. Banjur digulung dadi silinder lan &lt;a href="Kukus"&gt;dikukus&lt;/a&gt;. 
