<doc id="174987" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174987" title="Sosis Wina">
Sosis Wina

Sosis Wina (basa &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;: Wiener Würstchen, Wiener ; Jerman Wina / Ostenrik: Frankfurter Würstel utawa Würstl ; Jerman Jerman: Wienerli ; Swabian: Wienerle utawa Saitenwurst) punika lancip &lt;a href="Br%C3%BChwurst"&gt;sosis parboiled&lt;/a&gt; tradisional saka &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; ing casing saka &lt;a href="Wedhus%20g%C3%A8mb%C3%A8l"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt; usus 's, banjur diwenehi suhu kurang &lt;a href="Pangasepan"&gt;udud&lt;/a&gt;. Tembung Wiener iku basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; kanggo basa &lt;a href="Wina"&gt;Wina&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Ostenrik, istilah "Wiener" ora umum kanggo panganan iki, sing biasane diarani &lt;a href="Frankfurter%20W%C3%BCrstchen"&gt;Frankfurter Würstl&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan-bahan, persiapan, ukuran, lan rasa bisa beda-beda gumantung karo pabrike lan wilayah sing adol.
