<doc id="174990" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=174990" title="Hot dog kèju">
Hot dog kèju

Hot dog keju minangka hot dog &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;panas sing disajeni&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Keju%20sing%20wis%20diproses"&gt;keju olahan&lt;/a&gt; utawa diiseni ing njero, minangka &lt;a href="Pangisian"&gt;ngisi&lt;/a&gt;
Ing &lt;a href="Chicago%2C%20Illinois"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt; ana variasi asu bebaya sing diarani Francheezie. Biasane ditemokake ing restoran " &lt;a href="Sendhok%20lenga"&gt;sendok berminyak,&lt;/a&gt; " kalebu asu panas jumbo sing dipisah ing tengah lan diisi karo keju Cheddar (utawa Vveteta). Wis dibungkus &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;digoreng&lt;/a&gt;, banjur disajikake ing roti panggang.
Variasi liyane yaiku asu panas sing paling ndhuwur karo &lt;a href="Markuni%20lan%20k%C3%A8ju"&gt;macaroni lan keju&lt;/a&gt;.
Anjing reuben bisa kalebu segawon panas sing ditambah kombinasi bahan kayata daging sapi jagung, &lt;a href="Sau%C3%A9rkraut"&gt;sauerkraut&lt;/a&gt;, keju Switserlan lan klamben Ruslan.
Asu panas gaya Seattle, kadhang diarani "Anjing Seattle," yaiku asu panas sing diwenehi keju krim sing wis populer ing Seattle, &lt;a href="Washington%20%28praja%29"&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt;.
Schazer Switserlan minangka variasi regional sing kalebu &lt;a href="Bratwurst"&gt;bratwurst sing&lt;/a&gt; disajikake karo keju Switserlan lan sauerkraut. Ing San Diego, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, asu panas gaya Switserlan sing diarani "Swiener" disiapake karo asu panas lan keju Raclette sing diiseni ing roti &lt;a href="Baguette"&gt;baguette sing wis&lt;/a&gt; suwung.
