<doc id="175082" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175082" title="Olahan Swèdhen">
Olahan Swèdhen

Masakan Swèdhen minangka panganan tradisional wong &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga jembaré Swèdhen sisih Lor-kidul sing gedhe, ana bedane regional antarane masakan Swèdhen Lor lan Kidul.
Historis, ing sisih lor adoh, daging kaya ta &lt;a href="reindeer"&gt;reindeer&lt;/a&gt;kuva, lan liyane (koma) &lt;a href="Game%20%28mburu%29"&gt;game&lt;/a&gt; pasugatan padha dipangan, sawetara kang duwe werna ing &lt;a href="Wong%20S%C3%A1mi"&gt;budaya Sami&lt;/a&gt;, nalika seger sayuran wis diputer peran gedhe ing Kidul. Akeh panganan tradisional nggunakake rasa sing beda lan kontras, kaya ta sajian tradisional &lt;a href="Daging%20glindhing"&gt;bakso&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="saos"&gt;saos&lt;/a&gt; krim coklat kanthi tart, &lt;a href="Sel%C3%A9%20lingonb%C3%A9ri"&gt;selai lingonberry sing&lt;/a&gt; tajam (rasane padha karo saus cranberry).
