minangka panganan sing disiapake kanthi nutupi &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="rasa"&gt;rasa&lt;/a&gt; lan tekstur tambahan. Iku wangun saka pangan sing bisa rampung ing sawetara cara sing beda-beda, kalebu &lt;a href="Manggang"&gt;baking&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nggor%C3%A8ng"&gt;frying&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Panggang"&gt;Grilling&lt;/a&gt;. Pangan sing dibungkus daging babi populer kalebu Angels on Horseback, Devils on Horseback, lan &lt;a href="Babi%20ing%20kemul"&gt;Babi ing kemul&lt;/a&gt;.

