<doc id="175120" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175120" title="Brigadeiro">
Brigadeiro

 brigadeiro (Portuguese pronunciation: [bɾiga'dejɾu]) minangka panganan mulut tradisional &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt;, digawe dening panganan saka &lt;a href="Rio%20de%20Janeiro"&gt;Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt;, Heloisa Nabuco de Oliveira. Iki digawe saka &lt;a href="Susu%20kondensasi"&gt;susu kental&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woh%20Kakao"&gt;bubuk koko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Soklat"&gt;taburan coklat sing&lt;/a&gt; nutupi lapisan njaba. Variasi rasa lan manipulasi gampang panganan cuci mulut asli iki dadi pola resep sing beda-beda, kayata kue, tart, es krim utawa roti. Brigadeiro saiki bisa ditemokake ing macem-macem negara amarga imigrasi Brasil.
<h2>Referensi</h2>

