Casado (basa Spanyol tegese, "wong sing wis omah-omah") yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan saka &lt;a href="Costa%20Rica"&gt;Kosta Rika sing&lt;/a&gt; nggunakake &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;, kacang ireng, &lt;a href="Ngolah%20gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="salad"&gt;salad&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tortilla"&gt;tortilla&lt;/a&gt;, lan sumber protein opsional kayata &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;daging pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, iwak lan liya-liyane.

