Sop babat

Sup babat utawa babat godhog yaiku &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebus sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe &lt;a href="Babat"&gt;jeroan&lt;/a&gt; (weteng utawa wedhus / weteng).
