<doc id="175216" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175216" title="Roti lapis sarapan">
Roti lapis sarapan

Ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Lor"&gt;Amerika Utara&lt;/a&gt;, roti lapis sarapan yaiku &lt;a href="Sandwich"&gt;sandwich sing&lt;/a&gt; diisi panganan sing ana gandhengane karo &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt;. Breakfast sandwiches sing dadi ing &lt;a href="Panganan%20cepet%20saji"&gt;cepet pangan&lt;/a&gt; restoran (contone, ing Burger King sarapan sandwiches) lan delicatessens utawa tuku minangka cepet, siap kanggo panas lan mangan sandwiches saka toko. Sandwich sarapan umume digawe ing omah. Macem-macem jinis roti lapis sarapan kalebu sandwich &lt;a href="Roti%20isi%20babi"&gt;daging babi, roti lapis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lapis%20endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, lan sandwich sosis ; utawa macem-macem kombinasi, kaya ta &lt;a href="Roti%20isi%20babi%2C%20endhog%20lan%20k%C3%A8ju"&gt;roti lapis, endhog lan keju&lt;/a&gt;. Sandwich sarapan ana gandhengane karo &lt;a href="Sarapan%20gulung"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt;.
Sandwich sarapan biasane digawe nggunakake daging sarapan (umume daging sing diobati kaya ta sosis, sosis patty, daging babi, ham negara, &lt;a href="scrapple"&gt;scrapple&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Spam%20%28panganan%29"&gt;Spam&lt;/a&gt; lan daging babi), roti, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;. Sandwich iki biasane dadi spesialisasi regional nganti restoran &lt;a href="Panganan%20cepet%20saji"&gt;panganan cepat saji&lt;/a&gt; wiwit sarapan. Amarga umum jinis roti, kaya ta &lt;a href="Biskuit"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bagel"&gt;bagel&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="muffin%20Inggris"&gt;muffin Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, padha padha ing ukuran kanggo cepet pangan &lt;a href="hamburger"&gt;hamburger&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Roti%20bundher"&gt;buns&lt;/a&gt;, padha digawe pilihan ketok restoran cepet pangan. Ora kaya barang sarapan liyane, cocog banget kanggo inovasi &lt;a href="drive-through"&gt;drive-through&lt;/a&gt;. Sandwich iki uga wis dadi pokok akeh &lt;a href="Minimarket"&gt;toko serba ana&lt;/a&gt;.

