Neer dosa

Neer dosa, tegesé dosa banyu ing Tulu, minangka &lt;a href="Cr%C3%AApe"&gt;crépe sing&lt;/a&gt; disiyapake saka &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;pari&lt;/a&gt;. Neer dosa minangka panganan enak saka wilayah Tulu Nadu, lan bagean saka masakan Udupi - Mangalorean. Beda karo &lt;a href="Dosa"&gt;dosas&lt;/a&gt; neer dosa liyane sing misuwur kanthi metode &lt;a href="Dosa"&gt;persiyapan sing&lt;/a&gt; gampang lan kurang &lt;a href="Ferm%C3%A8ntasi"&gt;fermentasi&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane neer dosa disedhiyakake karo asam &lt;a href="Uwang%20klapa"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sambar"&gt;sambar&lt;/a&gt;, saagu lan kari non vegetarian kaya daging pitik, daging babi, iwak lan kari endhog. 
