Racuchy

Racuchy () minangka &lt;a href="Olahan%20Polen"&gt;sajian&lt;/a&gt; tradisional &lt;a href="Olahan%20Polen"&gt;Polandia&lt;/a&gt; saka kulawarga panganan sing padha karo &lt;a href="Cr%C3%AApe"&gt;crépe&lt;/a&gt; lan padha karo &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;pancake&lt;/a&gt; Amerika. Racuchy digawe saka &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; jiwit. Racuchy digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt; utawa, ing versi liyane, &lt;a href="Bubuk%20panggang"&gt;bubuk&lt;/a&gt; manggang utawa soda kue. Racuchy wajan ing lenga. Ing &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polandia&lt;/a&gt;, racuchy biasane dipangan kanggo &lt;a href="Mangan%20wengi"&gt;nedha bengi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;cemilan&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Mangan%20wengi"&gt;nedha&lt;/a&gt; bengi. Racuchy bisa dipangan kosong, disiram karo gula, utawa dicampur karo &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt;. Ing versi alternatif sawetara &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Krim%20asem"&gt;krim sing ora nguntungke&lt;/a&gt; bisa digunakake.

