<doc id="175257" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175257" title="Saos chaudfroid">
Saos chaudfroid

Saus Chaudfroid, uga dieja minangka saus chaud-froid, yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; kuliner sing bisa disiyapake nggunakake nyuda mambu daging lan bahan liyane. Preparasi saos sing luwih gampang ngilangi panggunaan daging, lan sawetara nggunakake saos kaya ta espagnole, &lt;a href="Saos%20allemande"&gt;allemande&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20velout%C3%A9"&gt;velouté&lt;/a&gt; minangka basis. Saus Chaudfroid biasane disajikake daging adhem, ing ndhuwur, lan panganan adhedhasar daging kaya ta &lt;a href="galantine"&gt;galantine&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Terrine%20%28panganan%29"&gt;terrine&lt;/a&gt;.

</doc>
<doc id="175258" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175258" title="Terrine">
Terrine

Terrine (]), minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan tradisional &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Prancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, punika jinis &lt;a href="Aspik"&gt;aspic&lt;/a&gt;, padha karo &lt;a href="P%C3%A2t%C3%A9"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, sing masak ing jamur Pottery dijamin (uga disebut terrine) ing bain-marie. Teras modern ora mesthi ngemot lemak daging utawa kewan, nanging isih ngemot tekstur kaya daging lan sulih lemak, kayata &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt; lan woh-wohan murni utawa sayuran sing akeh ing pektin. Uga bisa dimasak ing macem-macem cetakan terrine non-tembikar, kayata stainless steel, &lt;a href="Alumuniyum"&gt;aluminium&lt;/a&gt;, besi cor enamel, lan &lt;a href="plastik"&gt;plastik&lt;/a&gt; anti oven.
