<doc id="175261" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175261" title="Endhog keluk">
Endhog keluk

Endhog asap minangka salah sawijining jinis panganan sing kalebu &lt;a href="Pangasepan"&gt;keluk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Endhog"&gt;endhog iwak&lt;/a&gt;. Endhog asap bisa disiyapake nganggo &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog rebus keras&lt;/a&gt; banjur banjur asap, utawa endhog sing durung dimasak ing cangkang. Kajaba iku, endhog asap wis ditemtokake minangka jinis &lt;a href="hors%20d%27oeuvre"&gt;hors d'oeuvre&lt;/a&gt; endhog rebus sing dikepeng, &lt;a href="Marinasi"&gt;diasinake&lt;/a&gt; banjur dirokok. 
