<doc id="175268" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175268" title="Roti isi bakso">
Roti isi bakso

Roti isi bakso yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan umum &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; bagéan saka sawetara masakan, kalebu masakan Italia-Amérika lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;masakan Amérika&lt;/a&gt;. 
Sandwich utamane kalebu &lt;a href="Daging%20glindhing"&gt;bakso&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saus%20tomat"&gt;saos tomat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saus%20tomat"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Saos%20marinara"&gt;marinara&lt;/a&gt;, lan roti, kayata roti, &lt;a href="Baguette"&gt;baguette,&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roti%20gulung"&gt;roti Italia&lt;/a&gt;. Keju kayata provolone lan mozzarella kadang digunakake minangka bahan. Bahan-bahan tambahan bisa kalebu papak, lada ijo lan mentega, lan liya-liyane. Kadhangkala disiapake kanthi bentuk &lt;a href="Roti%20lapis%20prau%20silem"&gt;sandwich kapal selam&lt;/a&gt;. 
