<doc id="175272" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175272" title="Babi gulung">
Babi gulung

Gulung babi (uga dikenal kanthi regional minangka Taylor ham) minangka salah sawijining jinis panganan daging olahan adhedhasar daging babi sing umume kasedhiya ing &lt;a href="New%20Jersey"&gt;New Jersey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Delaware"&gt;Delaware&lt;/a&gt;, lan bagean ing &lt;a href="New%20York%20%28praja%29"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pennsylvania"&gt;Pennsylvania&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Maryland"&gt;Maryland&lt;/a&gt;. Iki digawe ing taun 1856 dening John Taylor saka Hamilton Square, New Jersey, lan didol dadi "Taylor's Prepared Ham". Produsen liyane lumebu pasar, lan peraturan label panganan sabanjure mbutuhake Taylor milih minangka "daging babi" bebarengan karo para pesainge. Nalika " Taylor " kanthi teknis minangka merek daging babi, ing wilayah Lor lan Tengah Jersey, kabeh merek daging babi bisa uga diarani "Taylor Ham" amarga John Taylor menehi merek daging babi asline minangka Taylor's Prepared Ham.
