Stik salisbury

Steak Salisbury minangka salah sawijining jinis sajian, sing asale saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;, digawe saka campuran &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20giling"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan bahan liyane lan biasane disajeni nganggo &lt;a href="Duduh%20kenthel"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Saos%20soklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20soklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;. Iki versi &lt;a href="Stik%20Hamburg"&gt;steak Hamburg&lt;/a&gt;.

