<doc id="175280" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175280" title="Fettuccine">
Fettuccine

Fettuccine (] ; secara harfiah 'pita cilik' ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Itali"&gt;basa Italia&lt;/a&gt; ; nyanyi fettuccina) kalebu jinis &lt;a href="Pasta"&gt;pasta sing&lt;/a&gt; populer ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;masakan&lt;/a&gt; Roma lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;Tuscan&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka pasta sing rata lan kandel sing biasane digawe saka &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt; (biasane endhog kanggo saben 100 g tepung), luwih sempit tinimbang, nanging padha karo &lt;a href="tagliatelle"&gt;tagliatelle&lt;/a&gt; khas &lt;a href="Bologna"&gt;Bologna&lt;/a&gt;. Fettuccine bayam digawe saka &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayem&lt;/a&gt;, glepung, lan endhog.
Fettuccine biasane digawe &lt;a href="Pasta"&gt;seger&lt;/a&gt; (ing omah utawa komersial), nanging fettuccine &lt;a href="Pasta"&gt;garing&lt;/a&gt; uga bisa dituku ing toko.
