<doc id="175325" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175325" title="Chongqing manci panas">
Chongqing manci panas

Chongqing (simplified Chinese), uga dikenal minangka panci panas pedhes, biasane dipangan ing restoran, nanging uga padha karo &lt;a href="Malatang"&gt;malatang ing&lt;/a&gt; pinggir &lt;a href="Malatang"&gt;dalan&lt;/a&gt;. Panci panas Chongqing padha karo mala xiang guo goreng garing (麻辣 香 锅) sing uga dipangan ing restoran. Cara mangan pot panas yaiku nempatake panganan ing panci panas, ngenteni panganan kanggo masak, yen panganan wis siyap, celup nganggo &lt;a href="Lenga%20wij%C3%A9n"&gt;minyak wijen&lt;/a&gt; banjur mangan. Wong bisa mangan macem-macem jinis panganan nganggo panci panas Chongqing, kayata daging sapi, daging babi, pitik, &lt;a href="Sosis%20China"&gt;sosis Cina&lt;/a&gt;, strip daging sapi, getih babi, usus bebek.
