<doc id="175326" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175326" title="Ghormeh sabzi">
Ghormeh sabzi

Sabzi Ghormeh (&lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;: قورمه‌ سبزی‎‎ ; uga ditulis minangka sabzi qormeh) iku sawijining Iranian &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;Herb&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;godhok&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka panganan sing populer banget ing &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt;. 
<h2>Nggawe</h2>
Nggawe.
Bahan utama yaiku campuran ramuan &lt;a href="Ngos%C3%A8ng"&gt;tumis&lt;/a&gt;, sing umume kalebu &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brambang%20pr%C3%A9i"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;bawang ijo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="ketumbar"&gt;ketumbar&lt;/a&gt;, dibumboni bumbu utama godhong &lt;a href="Kelabat"&gt;fenugreek sing wis&lt;/a&gt; garing. Campuran ramuan duwe macem-macem variasi. Sayuran ijo pait peteng bisa digunakake, kayata kale, sayuran sawi, utawa sayuran empuk, sanajan ora kalebu bagean saka resep asli. 
Campuran iki dimasak nganggo &lt;a href="kacang%20ginjel"&gt;kacang ginjel&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kacang%20ginjel"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kacang%20polong"&gt;polong&lt;/a&gt; kuning, &lt;a href="Brambang%20abang"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; kuning utawa &lt;a href="Brambang%20abang"&gt;abang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeruk%20nipis%20garing"&gt;jeruk nipis ireng&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Jeruk%20nipis%20P%C3%A8rsia"&gt;jeruk nipis Persia&lt;/a&gt; limu-Omani sing wis ditusuk), lan wedhus utawa daging sapi sing dikencengi &lt;a href="Kunir"&gt;kunyit&lt;/a&gt;. Piring kasebut banjur &lt;a href="Pilaf"&gt;disedhiyakake&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Pilaf"&gt;chelow&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;nasi&lt;/a&gt; parboiled lan kukus Persia) utawa liwat &lt;a href="Intip"&gt;tahdig&lt;/a&gt;. Vegetarian ghormeh sabzi bisa ngganti daging walnut utawa daging jamur. 
