<doc id="175343" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175343" title="Olahan Amérika Latin">
Olahan Amérika Latin

Masakan Amerika Latin minangka panganan khas, omben-omben, lan gaya masak umume kanggo pirang-pirang negara lan budaya ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Latin"&gt;Amerika Latin&lt;/a&gt;. Amerika Latin minangka wilayah sing akeh macem-macem negara sing bangsane duwe macem-macem masakan. Sawetara barang khas masakan Amerika Latin kalebu masakan adhedhasar &lt;a href="Jagung"&gt;jagung yaiku&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Arepa"&gt;pas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pupusa"&gt;pupusas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="taco"&gt;taco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tamal%C3%A9"&gt;tamales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tortilla"&gt;tortilla&lt;/a&gt; lan macem-macem &lt;a href="salsa"&gt;salsa&lt;/a&gt; lan bumbu liyane (&lt;a href="Guacamol%C3%A9"&gt;guacamole&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pico%20de%20gallo"&gt;pico de gallo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saos%20mol%C3%A9"&gt;mole&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="chimichurri"&gt;chimichurri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;chili&lt;/a&gt;, aji, &lt;a href="pebre"&gt;pebre&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;a href="Sofrito"&gt;Sofrito&lt;/a&gt;, istilah kuliner sing wiwitane nuduhake kombinasi aromatik tumis utawa brised tartamtu, ana ing masakan Amerika Latin. Iki nuduhake saos tomat, lada panggang, papak, bawang lan jamu.
Omben-omben ing Amerika Latin padha beda karo panganan. Sawetara omben-omben bisa uga wiwit jaman Amerika Pribumi. Sawetara omben-omben populer kalebu &lt;a href="Kafe"&gt;kopi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mat%C3%A9"&gt;mate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C3%A8h%20kembang%20sepatu"&gt;teh kembang sepatu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="horchata"&gt;horchata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="chicha"&gt;chicha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="atole"&gt;atole&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Soklat%20panas"&gt;cacao&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Agua%20fresca"&gt;aguas fraser&lt;/a&gt;.
Desserts ing Amerika Latin umume rasane manis banget. &lt;a href="Dulce%20de%20leche"&gt;Yaiku&lt;/a&gt; kalebu &lt;a href="dulce%20de%20leche"&gt;dulce de leche&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alfajor"&gt;alfajor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pudhing%20sega"&gt;puding beras&lt;/a&gt;, kue tres leches, &lt;a href="teja"&gt;teja&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cr%C3%A8me%20karam%C3%A8l"&gt;flan&lt;/a&gt;.
