<doc id="175365" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175365" title="Piña colada">
Piña colada

Piña colada (; &lt;a href="basa%20Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;: piña], "nanas", lan colada], "ketegangan") minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Koktail"&gt;koktail sing&lt;/a&gt; legi digawe karo &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;ram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Santen"&gt;krim klapa&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="santen"&gt;santen&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="jus%20nanas"&gt;jus nanas&lt;/a&gt;, biasane disajikake utawa diaduk karo es. Bisa dihiasi nganggo irisan nanas, ceri maraschino, utawa kalorone. Ana rong versi omben, sing asale ing &lt;a href="Puerto%20Rico"&gt;Puerto Rico&lt;/a&gt;.
