<doc id="175373" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175373" title="Michelada">
Michelada

Michelada (pocapan &lt;a href="Basa%20Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;: [mitʃeˈlaða]) minangka &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n"&gt;omben&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n"&gt;omben sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe &lt;a href="bir"&gt;bir&lt;/a&gt;, jus &lt;a href="Jeruk%20limau"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, saos macem-macem (asring adhedhasar &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;chili&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah-rempah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jus%20tomat"&gt;jus tomat&lt;/a&gt;, lan mrico. Dadi ing gelas adhem, &lt;a href="Uyah"&gt;uyah sing wis digawe&lt;/a&gt; adhem. Ana macem-macem variasi ombenan iki ing saindenging &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;. 
Ing &lt;a href="Kutha%20M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Kutha Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, bentuk sing paling umum disiyapake nganggo bir, jeruk, uyah, lan saus panas utawa irisan chili. Ana sawetara bahan opsional liyane, kayata saus Maggi, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap"&gt;kecap&lt;/a&gt;, Tajín, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20inggris"&gt;saus Worcestershire&lt;/a&gt;, bubuk &lt;a href="chamoy"&gt;chamoy&lt;/a&gt;, mrico serrano, camaronazo (jus tomat adhedhasar udang), clamato, utawa irisan jeruk. 
