<doc id="175378" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175378" title="Tapa">
Tapa

Tapa minangka &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20domba"&gt;daging domba&lt;/a&gt;, daging rempah-rempah utawa &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Daging%20jaran"&gt;jaran sing wis&lt;/a&gt; garing utawa diobati, sanajan daging liyane utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak uga&lt;/a&gt; bisa digunakake. Wong Filipina nyiyapake tapa kanthi nggunakake irisan daging sing lancip lan ngobati uyah lan rempah-rempah minangka metode pelestarian. Tapa asring mateng digoreng utawa dipanggang. Nalika dadi karo beras goreng lan endhog goreng, kang dikenal minangka tapsilog (a portmanteau saka &lt;a href="Basa%20Filipino"&gt;Filipino&lt;/a&gt; tembung tapa, &lt;a href="Sinang%C3%A1g"&gt;sinangag&lt;/a&gt; lan itlog &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;). Kadhangkala &lt;a href="Atchara"&gt;diwenehake&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="atchara"&gt;atchara&lt;/a&gt;, strip papaya sing diasinake, utawa tomat sing diiris dadi &lt;a href="Panganan%20sisih"&gt;lawuh&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Cuka"&gt;Cuka&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20gedhang"&gt;saos tomat&lt;/a&gt; biasane digunakake kanggo &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt;.
Tapsilog minangka istilah sing digunakake nalika tapa, nasi &lt;a href="Sega%20gor%C3%A8ng%20%28internasional%29"&gt;goreng bawang putih&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Sinang%C3%A1g"&gt;sinangag&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; goreng (itlog) digabung dadi siji panganan, utamane disajeni nalika &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt;. Ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;, restoran sing utamane nglayani tapa diarani tapahan, tapsihan utawa tapsilugan. Miturut sawetara sumber, tapsilog lan tapsihan kalebu tembung gaul. Nanging, istilah kasebut digunakake dening restoran kasebut lan akeh wong Filipina saka kabeh lapisan sosial. Mula, Tapsilog lan tapsihan bisa dianggep tembung baku ing basa Filipina tinimbang basa gaul.
