<doc id="175414" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175414" title="Belis">
Belis

Belize (), formerly known as &lt;a href="British%20Honduras"&gt;British Honduras&lt;/a&gt;, is a &lt;a href="Caribbean"&gt;Caribbean&lt;/a&gt; country located on the northeastern coast of &lt;a href="Central%20America"&gt;Central America&lt;/a&gt;. Belize is bordered on the north by &lt;a href="Mexico"&gt;Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, on the east by the &lt;a href="Caribbean%20Sea"&gt;Caribbean Sea&lt;/a&gt;, and on the south and west by &lt;a href="Guatemala"&gt;Guatemala&lt;/a&gt;. It has an area of 8867 sqmi and a population of 419,199 (2020). Its mainland is about 290 km long and 110 km wide. It has the lowest population and &lt;a href="population%20density"&gt;population density&lt;/a&gt; in Central America. The country's population growth rate of 1.87% per year (2018 estimate) is the second highest in the region and one of the &lt;a href="List%20of%20countries%20by%20population%20growth%20rate"&gt;highest in the Western Hemisphere&lt;/a&gt;.

</doc>
<doc id="175443" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175443" title="Pasisir Karta">
Pasisir Karta

Pasisir Karta utawa Costa Rica yaiku &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; paling cilik nomer loro ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Tengah"&gt;Amérika Tengah&lt;/a&gt; kang wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Nikaragua"&gt;Nikaragua&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih lor, &lt;a href="Panama"&gt;Panama&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kidul- kidul-wétan, &lt;a href="Samodra%20Pasifik"&gt;Samodra Pasifik&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kulon lan kidul, lan &lt;a href="Sagara%20Karibia"&gt;Sagara Karibia&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih wétan. Pasisir Karta minangka nagara pengonsumsi &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; paling akèh ing donya. Taun 1980, konsumsi rata-rata per jiwa punjul 65&amp;nbsp;kg kang tegesé saben wong mangan 1,7 ons gula sadina. Nagara iki ndarbèni tingkat pulitik paling aman ing kawasané. Dibandingaké karo nagara-nagara Amérika Latin liyané, Pasisir Karta unggul sajeroning pikolèhan per kapita. Kasil utama nagara kang wewengkoné udakara 51.100 &lt;a href="km%C2%B2"&gt;km²&lt;/a&gt; iki yaiku &lt;a href="kopi"&gt;kopi&lt;/a&gt;.
