<doc id="175485" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175485" title="Makarony po-flotski">
Makarony po-flotski

Makarony po-flotski (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: макароны по-флотски, secara harfiah pasta gaya angkatan laut) minangka panganan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka pasta sing dimasak (&lt;a href="Fusilli"&gt;umume&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Markuni"&gt;makaroni&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9nn%C3%A9"&gt;penne&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="fusilli"&gt;fusilli&lt;/a&gt;) dicampur karo &lt;a href="Fusilli"&gt;isian sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka daging rebus (biasane &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;), digoreng &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; lan dibumbui &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwitane disedhiyakake ing angkatan laut, sajian kasebut dadi populer ing Ruslan amarga kesederhanaan, biaya murah lan nyepetake anggone nyiyapake. Makarony po-flotski dadi misuwur banget sawise &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Dunia II&lt;/a&gt; nalika mlarat ing &lt;a href="Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Uni Soviet&lt;/a&gt;. 
Pasta kasebut dimasak ing banyu sing umob asin. Bawang kasebut dicincang kanthi apik, sanajan daging dicincang. Sawise diwutahake minyak ing wajan, bawang bombay sing wis disigar digoreng lan sawise entuk warna emas, daging banjur ditambahake supaya digoreng. Daging sing &lt;a href="Tushonka"&gt;digiling&lt;/a&gt; bisa diganti karo daging kaleng (&lt;a href="tushonka"&gt;tushonka&lt;/a&gt;). Isi kasebut dibumboni uyah lan mrico. Nalika daging digoreng lan pasta wis mateng banjur dicampur. Sajian biasane disajikake tanpa tambahan, nanging bisa dipangan nganggo &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;acar&lt;/a&gt;.
