<doc id="175520" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175520" title="Susu mertéga koldskål">
Susu mertéga koldskål

Buttermilk koldskål (basa Danish, asring koldskål - mangkuk adhem kanthi harfiah) minangka &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n"&gt;omben&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; cuci &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut&lt;/a&gt; adhem sing legi sing dipangan ing &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt;.
Koldskål digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Susu%20mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;buttermilk&lt;/a&gt; lan bahan-bahan liyane: &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; lan / utawa produk susu liyane, &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt;, lan kadang lemon. Piring kasebut muncul nalika buttermilk umume kasedhiya ing Dhènemarken ing wiwitan taun 1900an lan biasane dipangan nalika musim panas minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;cuci&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;cemilan&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit taun 1979, wis ana varietas siap-siap ing pasar Dhènemarken, asale saka Esbjerg Dairy, nanging saiki saka pirang-pirang dairies, kalebu Arla.
