Tartiflette

Tartiflette (]) yaiku panganan saka &lt;a href="Savoy"&gt;Savoy&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Pegunungan%20Alpen%20Prancis"&gt;Alps Perancis&lt;/a&gt;. Kang digawe karo &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="reblochon"&gt;reblochon&lt;/a&gt; keju, &lt;a href="Lardon"&gt;lardons&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. 
