<doc id="175601" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175601" title="Ashure">
Ashure

Ashure (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;: aşure) utawa puding Nuh minangka bubur &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; cuci &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;mulut&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt; sing digawe saka campuran sing kasusun saka &lt;a href="Wiji-wijian"&gt;biji&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Wiji-wijian"&gt;bijian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woh%20garing"&gt;woh-wohan garing&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kacang%20woh"&gt;kacang-kacangan&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, disedhiyakake sajrone taun, utamane sajrone &lt;a href="Muharram"&gt;Muharram&lt;/a&gt;, wulan kapisan &lt;a href="Pananggalan%20Hijriyah"&gt;tanggalan Islam&lt;/a&gt;, amarga tanggal 10 Muharrem cocog karo &lt;a href="Dina%20Asyura"&gt;Dina Ashure&lt;/a&gt;. (" &lt;a href="Dina%20Asyura"&gt;Ashura&lt;/a&gt; " yaiku &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "sepuluh"). Biasane, abu digawe akeh kanggo mengeti pendaratan pethi lan disebarake menyang kanca, sedulur, tangga teparo, kolega, kanca sakelas, lan liya-liyane, tanpa nggatekake agama utawa sistem kapercayan panampa minangka aturan perdamaian lan katresnan. Ashure tradisional digawe lan dipangan sajrone wulan sing luwih adhem taun iki amarga sifat sing akeh lan kalori, nanging saiki bisa dirasakake saubenging taun.
