&lt;a href="Chorba"&gt;Panganan&lt;/a&gt; nasional sing misuwur kayata: &lt;a href="Chorba"&gt;shurpa&lt;/a&gt; (shurva utawa shorva), &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka potongan-potongan daging lemak (biasane daging babi) lan &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt; seger; &lt;a href="Naryn"&gt;norin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Laghman"&gt;lagman&lt;/a&gt;, piring adhedhasar mie sing bisa dadi sup utawa panganan utama; &lt;a href="manti"&gt;manti&lt;/a&gt; (uga diarani qasqoni), &lt;a href="Joshpara"&gt;chuchvara&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Samsa"&gt;somsa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; kanthong sing diiseni dadi panganan pembuka utawa kursus utama; &lt;a href="dimlama"&gt;dimlama&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Dimlama"&gt;rebus&lt;/a&gt; daging lan sayuran) lan macem-macem &lt;a href="kebab"&gt;kebab&lt;/a&gt;, biasane dadi &lt;a href="Dimlama"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; utama.
