<doc id="175622" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175622" title="Janchi-guksu">
Janchi-guksu

Janchi-guksu (basa Korea: 잔치 국수) utawa mi perjamuan yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa sajian &lt;a href="Guksu"&gt;mi Korea sing kalebu mie&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Glepung%20gandum"&gt;tepung gandum&lt;/a&gt; ing duduh kaldu ringan sing digawe saka &lt;a href="iwak%20teri"&gt;iwak teri&lt;/a&gt; lan kadhang uga dasima (kelp). &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;Duduh&lt;/a&gt; kaldu &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; bisa uga diganti duduh kaldu teri. Dadi karo saos sing digawe saka &lt;a href="Lenga%20wij%C3%A9n"&gt;minyak wijen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap"&gt;ganjang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bubuk%20lombok"&gt;bubuk cabai&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;daun bawang cilik&lt;/a&gt;. Irisan &lt;a href="Hiasan%20endhog"&gt;jidan&lt;/a&gt; (지단, endhog goreng) sing tipis, ditambah (&lt;a href="gim"&gt;gim&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Zukini"&gt;zucchini&lt;/a&gt; ditambahake ing ndhuwur sajian minangka &lt;a href="Hiasan%20panganan"&gt;hiasan&lt;/a&gt;. Janchi-guksu duwe macem-macem hiasan kanthi mi. Tembung "Janchi" tegese "pesta" ing basa Korea. Jeneng kasebut asale saka ngendi wong bisa ngrasakake ing dina riyaya kayata nikahan utawa ulang taun kaping sewidak. &lt;a href="https%3A//ko.dict.naver.com/%23/entry/koko/02679ef5bd7648e68d2511d9f92eaca3"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
