<doc id="175727" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175727" title="Kuwé flan">
Kuwé flan

Cake flan, uga dikenal minangka cake Leche flan utawa creme cake caramel, punika Salah sawijining jinis olahan Filipino &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20chiffon"&gt;chiffon&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20spons"&gt;karang&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="mam%C3%B3n"&gt;mamón&lt;/a&gt;) panggang karo lapisan saka &lt;a href="Cr%C3%A8me%20karam%C3%A8l"&gt;Leche flan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Cr%C3%A8me%20karam%C3%A8l"&gt;creme caramel&lt;/a&gt;) ing ndhuwur karo &lt;a href="Karam%C3%A8l"&gt;caramel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt;. Kadang dikenal kanthi jeneng "kue kastard", sing mbingungake karo kue yema. Kue flan versi modern bisa dimasak kanthi macem-macem bahan sing ditambahake. Tuladhane yaiku nggunakake &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20tela%20wungu"&gt;kue ube&lt;/a&gt; minangka pangkalan. &lt;a href="Mam%C3%B3n"&gt;Panganan cuci&lt;/a&gt; mulut Filipina sing padha sing nggunakake &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20mangkok"&gt;cupcake&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kukus"&gt;kukus&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Mam%C3%B3n"&gt;puto mamón&lt;/a&gt;) minangka pangkalan kasebut diarani &lt;a href="Puto"&gt;puto flan&lt;/a&gt;. Kue &lt;a href="Flancocho"&gt;flan&lt;/a&gt; mirip banget karo &lt;a href="flancocho"&gt;flancocho&lt;/a&gt; sajian &lt;a href="Olahan%20Puerto%20Rico"&gt;Puerto Rico&lt;/a&gt;, kajaba sing kalebu &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20krim"&gt;krim keju&lt;/a&gt;. 
