<doc id="175738" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175738" title="Coulibiac">
Coulibiac

 coulibiac (saka basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: кулебя́ка, kulebyáka) yaiku salah sawijining jinis &lt;a href="pirog"&gt;pirog&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan sing&lt;/a&gt; biasane diisi &lt;a href="Iwak%20Salmon"&gt;salmon&lt;/a&gt; utawa bahan bakar, &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; utawa soba, &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog rebus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="dill"&gt;dill&lt;/a&gt;. Pie dipanggang ing cangkang kue, biasane &lt;a href="brioche"&gt;brioche&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pastry%20puff"&gt;roti puff&lt;/a&gt;.
Grand coulibiac klasik nampilake pirang-pirang isi, asring dicampur sawetara &lt;a href="Ikan%20putih%20%28istilah%20perikanan%29"&gt;iwak putih&lt;/a&gt; lan beras kanggo lapisan ndhuwur lan ngisor kanthi isi steregeon utawa salmon. Bahan sing paling ora umum umume kalebu ing versi utama sajian yaiku vesiga, &lt;a href="Sungsum%20balung"&gt;sumsum&lt;/a&gt; balung &lt;a href="Sungsum%20balung"&gt;mburi&lt;/a&gt; bahan bakar.
