Saos sewu pulo

Saos Ewonan Pulo yaiku &lt;a href="Salad"&gt;dressing&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;rempah-rempah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="salad"&gt;salad&lt;/a&gt; Amerika adhedhasar &lt;a href="Mayon%C3%A8s"&gt;mayones&lt;/a&gt; sing bisa kalebu &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jus%20jeruk"&gt;jus jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20inggris"&gt;saus Worcestershire&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saos%20lombok"&gt;saus cabai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tomat%20pur%C3%A9e"&gt;tomat puree&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saos%20tomat"&gt;saus tomat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="saos%20Tabasco"&gt;saos Tabasco&lt;/a&gt;. 
