<doc id="175765" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175765" title="Olahan Thalassery">
Olahan Thalassery

Masakan Thalassery nuduhake &lt;a href="Masakan"&gt;masakan sing&lt;/a&gt; beda-beda saka kutha &lt;a href="Thalassery"&gt;Thalassery ing&lt;/a&gt; sisih lor &lt;a href="Kerala"&gt;Kerala&lt;/a&gt;, sing wis dicampur karo gaya masak Arab, Persia, India lan Eropa minangka asil sejarah sing dawa minangka &lt;a href="Pesisir%20Malabar"&gt;pos dagang maritim&lt;/a&gt;. Thalassery misuwur amarga &lt;a href="biryani"&gt;biryani&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pakaryan"&gt;Tellicherry&lt;/a&gt; (ing dialek lokal, biri-yaa-ni). Beda karo masakan biriyani liyane &lt;a href="Thalassery%20biryani"&gt;Thalassery biryani&lt;/a&gt; (Tellicherry biriyaani) sing digawe nganggo Kaima / &lt;a href="Jeerakasala"&gt;Jeerakasala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sega%20arum"&gt;sega aromatik&lt;/a&gt; India tinimbang &lt;a href="Pari%20Basmati"&gt;nasi basmati sing&lt;/a&gt; biasane. Pengaruh budaya &lt;a href="Wong%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Wong%20Mughal"&gt;Moghul&lt;/a&gt; nyata, utamane ing masakan komunitas Muslim, sanajan akeh sing misuwur ing kabeh komunitas. 
Thalassery Falooda minangka varian regional kanggo panganan pencuci mulut Persia. Iki minangka koktail salad buah, woh-wohan garing kayata &lt;a href="Kismis"&gt;blackcurrant&lt;/a&gt;, pistachio, &lt;a href="Jambu%20m%C3%A9nt%C3%A9"&gt;mete&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="almond"&gt;almond&lt;/a&gt; (badam), susu mawar lan es krim vanilla.
