<doc id="175775" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175775" title="Fugazza">
Fugazza

Fugazza con queso (saka &lt;a href="Dialek%20Genoa"&gt;dhialèk Genoese&lt;/a&gt;: fugassa, &lt;a href="Basa%20Itali"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="focaccia"&gt;focaccia&lt;/a&gt;), utawa mung Fugazza, minangka jinis &lt;a href="pizza"&gt;pizza&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Arg%C3%A8ntina"&gt;Argentina sing&lt;/a&gt; asale ing &lt;a href="Buenos%20Aires"&gt;Buenos Aires&lt;/a&gt; sing kalebu kerak pizza kenthel sing ditutupi bawang, keju, lan kadang zaitun. Asale saka kombinasi &lt;a href="Neapolitan%20pizza"&gt;pizza Neapolitan&lt;/a&gt; karo roti &lt;a href="Focaccia"&gt;fokus&lt;/a&gt; Italia.
Fugazza lan variasine diyakini wis ditemokake dening produsen pizza &lt;a href="Genova"&gt;Genovese&lt;/a&gt; -Argentine sing jenenge Juan Banchero nalika taun 1893 lan 1932, sing nyedhiyakake toko pizza sing jenenge jenenge. Toko pizza Banchero tetep adol Fugazza nganti saiki ing lingkungan Buenos Aires La Boca, sing historis dadi omah para imigran Genovese menyang Argentina. 
