<doc id="175776" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175776" title="Palak paneer">
Palak paneer

Palak paneer (pronounced [paːlək pəniːɾ]) minangka &lt;a href="Olahan%20vegetarian"&gt;panganan vegetarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="paneer"&gt;paneer&lt;/a&gt; (jinis keju pondhok) ing &lt;a href="Pasta%20%28sambel%29"&gt;tempel&lt;/a&gt; kandel sing digawe saka &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;murni&lt;/a&gt;, diarani palak ing basa Hindi, Marathi, Gujarati, lan basa India liyane. 
Istilah palak paneer lan &lt;a href="Saag"&gt;saag paneer&lt;/a&gt; asring digunakake ing restoran ing Amerika Serikat lan Kanada. Nanging, paneler saag beda karo paneler palak tradisional amarga ngemot &lt;a href="Janganan%20godhong"&gt;sayuran godhong ijo&lt;/a&gt; liyane, kayata &lt;a href="sayuran%20sawi"&gt;sayuran sawi&lt;/a&gt;, dene paneler palak mung ngemot bayem. Restoran &lt;a href="dhaba"&gt;dhaba&lt;/a&gt; asring duwe spesialisasi panel palak.
<h2>Nglayani</h2>
Nglayani.
&lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;Panel panelak disedhiyakake&lt;/a&gt; panas kanthi sisih kayata &lt;a href="Roti%20India"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="naan"&gt;naan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paratha"&gt;paranthas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="makki%20di%20roti"&gt;makki di roti&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Sega"&gt;nasi rebus&lt;/a&gt;. Uga bisa disedhiyakake karo bawang ing sisih kanggo pendekatan sing luwih tradisional.
