Pudhing soklat

Puding coklat minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa kelas panganan cuci mulut kanthi rasa &lt;a href="Soklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;. Ana rong jinis utama: panganan cuci mulut sing digodhog banjur digawe adhem, tekstur minangka &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;kastor sing&lt;/a&gt; dipasang karo &lt;a href="Pathi"&gt;pati&lt;/a&gt;, umume dipangan ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;AS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polandia&lt;/a&gt;, lan Asia &lt;a href="Asia%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Kidul Kidul&lt;/a&gt; ; lan versi kukus / panggang, tekstur padha karo &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;kue&lt;/a&gt;, populer ing &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pulo%20Irlandia"&gt;Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;.

