Pudhing malva

Pudding Malva punika salah sawijining jinis olahan manis &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;pudding&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Kenya&lt;/a&gt; asal. Isine senggol aprikot lan tekstur &lt;a href="Karam%C3%A9lisasi"&gt;karamel&lt;/a&gt; spongy. Saus krim asring diwutahake nalika panas, lan biasane disajeni panas karo &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;kastard&lt;/a&gt; lan / utawa &lt;a href="%C3%88s%20krim"&gt;es krim&lt;/a&gt;. Akeh restoran Afrika Selatan sing nawakake.

