<doc id="175883" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175883" title="Olahan Ekuador">
Olahan Ekuador

Masakan Ekuador macem-macem, beda-beda karo dhuwure, lan kahanan pertanian sing ana gandhengane. &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;Daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan sagara&lt;/a&gt; misuwur ing wilayah pesisir lan biasane disajikake kanthi panganan kaya karbohidrat, kayata &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras sing&lt;/a&gt; diiringi &lt;a href="lentil"&gt;lentil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Ngolah%20gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt;, dene ing daerah pegunungan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan cuy (&lt;a href="Tikus%20walanda"&gt;guinea pig&lt;/a&gt;) misuwur lan asring disajekake karo &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;pari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;Panganan lurung sing&lt;/a&gt; populer ing wilayah pegunungan yaiku &lt;a href="hornado"&gt;hornado&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu kentang sing disajikan karo babi panggang. Sawetara conto masakan Ekuador patacones kalebu patacones (unripe &lt;a href="Ngolah%20gedhang"&gt;plantains&lt;/a&gt; goreng ing &lt;a href="Lenga%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;lenga&lt;/a&gt;, mashed munggah, lan banjur refried), llapingachos (werni kentang sing wajan), lan &lt;a href="seco%20de%20chivo"&gt;seco de chivo&lt;/a&gt; (jinis rebusan digawe saka &lt;a href="Wedhus%20domestik"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;). Kasedhiya macem-macem macem-macem woh-wohan, utamane ing ketinggian ngisor, kalebu &lt;a href="Sweet%20granadilla"&gt;granadilla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Markisa"&gt;fruitfruit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="naranjilla"&gt;naranjilla&lt;/a&gt;, sawetara jinis &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Physalis%20peruviana"&gt;uvilla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="taxo"&gt;taxo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="T%C3%A9rong%20walanda"&gt;tomat wit&lt;/a&gt;.
Panganan kasebut rada beda ing wilayah pegunungan sisih kidul, sing khas &lt;a href="Loja%20Province"&gt;Loja&lt;/a&gt; panganan kayata repe, sup sing disiapake karo gedhang ijo; cecina, daging &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt; panggang; lan miel con quesillo, utawa " cuajada ", minangka panganan cuci mulut. Ing &lt;a href="Hutan%20Hujan"&gt;alas udan&lt;/a&gt;, pokok panganan yaiku yuca, ing papan liya diarani &lt;a href="Ket%C3%A9la%20pohung"&gt;singkong&lt;/a&gt;. ROOT starchy dikupas lan digodhog, digoreng, utawa digunakake ing macem-macem panganan liyane. Ing saindenging negara kasebut, uga digunakake minangka roti, pan de yuca, sing padha karo &lt;a href="p%C3%A3o%20de%20queijo"&gt;pão de queijo&lt;/a&gt; Brasil lan asring dikonsumsi bebarengan karo macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;yogurt sing bisa&lt;/a&gt; dipombe. Akeh woh-wohan sing kasedhiya ing wilayah iki, kalebu &lt;a href="gedhang"&gt;gedhang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pourouma%20cecropiifolia"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bactris%20gasipaes"&gt;aren&lt;/a&gt;.

