<doc id="175907" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=175907" title="Yukgaejang">
Yukgaejang

Yukgaejang (&lt;a href="Hangul"&gt;Hangul&lt;/a&gt;: 육개장,肉개醬) utawa daging sapi sup pedhes ya iku sop pedhes &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Korea&lt;/a&gt; kang digawé saka daging sapi suwir lan brambang. Yukgaejang bagéan saka gom guk utawa sup kenthel sing mauné dihidhangke ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20Kadhaton%20Dinasti%20Joseon"&gt;masakan kadhaton Korea&lt;/a&gt;. Hidhangan iki dianggep sehat lan kondhang amarga panas lan pedhes. 
Saliyané daging sapi suwir, brambang, lan banyu, sajian iki biasané uga kalebu &lt;a href="tog%C3%A9"&gt;togé&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gosari"&gt;gosari&lt;/a&gt;, torandae, irisan &lt;a href="bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="dangmyeon"&gt;dangmyeon&lt;/a&gt; (mi kenthang legi), &lt;a href="Bubuk%20lombok"&gt;wêdakakêna chili&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="wiji%20perilla"&gt;wiji perilla&lt;/a&gt; (uga diarani wiji wijen liar), &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap"&gt;kecap&lt;/a&gt;, minyak (&lt;a href="Lenga%20wij%C3%A9n"&gt;minyak wijen&lt;/a&gt; lan/utawa minyak sayur), &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;. Yukgaejang biasané disajikaké karo sakulasan &lt;a href="Wos"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kimchi"&gt;kimchi&lt;/a&gt;.
